# ==========================================================================
# Ai-Learns-Play-Balatro — .gitignore
# Principle: commit source, docs and small configs only. Never commit build
# outputs, environments, secrets, training artifacts or any game files.
# ==========================================================================

# ---------- Secrets & credentials (never commit) ----------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.cer
*.der
*.jks
*.keystore
*secret*
*secrets*
*credential*
*credentials*
*.token
.token
token.json
token.txt
*_token.json
*_token.txt
.netrc
.pypirc
.npmrc
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.gpg
wandb/settings

# ---------- Proprietary game files (never commit) ----------
# The simulator models mechanics from public descriptions only.
*.love
Balatro*
!**/balatro_*
!**/balatro-*
game_files/
game_assets/
*.exe
*.dll
*.dylib

# ---------- Rust ----------
/target/
**/target/
*.rs.bk
*.profraw
*.profdata
perf.data*
flamegraph*.svg

